new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-a-3d-view-on-every-product\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce: a 3D view on every product<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-a-3d-view-on-every-product\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>A small Magento 2 module, <code>Ctruh_VerseViewer</code>, adds a <strong>Verse scene link</strong> attribute to products and shows the scene on the product page under the image gallery. The poster paints first; the 3D loads when the shopper scrolls to it.</p>\n<p><strong>Status:</strong> skeleton. The PHP parses and the XML and JSON are well-formed (<code>node integrations/embeds/check.mjs</code>), but the module has not been run on a Magento install yet. Expect a first-run fix or two.</p>\n<h2 id=\"install\">Install<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#install\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"sh\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-sh\">cp -r integrations/embeds/magento/Ctruh &lt;magento&gt;/app/code/\nbin/magento module:enable Ctruh_VerseViewer\nbin/magento setup:upgrade        # adds the product attribute\nbin/magento setup:di:compile     # production mode\nbin/magento cache:flush</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"use\">Use<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#use\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Catalog → Products → a product → the <strong>Verse 3D</strong> group → <strong>Verse scene link</strong>: paste the share link from <a href=\"/studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-studio\">Studio</a> (<code>https://verse.ctruh.com/?vpk=ingest/&lt;scene-id&gt;.vpk</code>). The attribute is store-view scoped, so each store view can show a different scene. The product page then shows the viewer under the gallery; products without a link show nothing.</p>\n<h2 id=\"settings-in-the-layout-file\">Settings (in the layout file)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#settings-in-the-layout-file\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>view/frontend/layout/catalog_product_view.xml</code>: <code>aspect</code> (<code>1:1</code> default; <code>16:9</code> for rooms), <code>max_width</code> (0 = the column), <code>load_on_tap</code>. To replace the gallery with the 3D view, uncomment the <code>remove=&quot;true&quot;</code> line for <code>product.info.media.image</code>. Self-hosted Verse servers: add the host to <code>Block/Product/Viewer.php</code>&#39;s <code>HOSTS</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"without-the-module\">Without the module<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#without-the-module\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Page Builder → <strong>HTML Code</strong>, or a CMS block: paste the HTML from Studio → the scene → Embed.</p>\n<h2 id=\"headless-pwa-studio-graphql\">Headless (PWA Studio, GraphQL)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#headless-pwa-studio-graphql\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>verse_scene_url</code> is an ordinary product attribute: on REST under <code>custom_attributes</code>, and on GraphQL once it is added to <code>ProductInterface</code> (a <code>schema.graphqls</code> extension, not in the skeleton). Frame its embed URL, or hand it to <code>&lt;verse-viewer src=&quot;…&quot;&gt;</code> (<code>https://verse.ctruh.com/sdk/verse-viewer.js</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"private-scenes\">Private scenes<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#private-scenes\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Use the share link with its token (Studio → Embed → <em>Create an embed share link</em>).</p>\n<p>More: <code>integrations/embeds/magento/README.md</code>.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#install\" id=\"lnk-install\">Install</a><a href=\"#use\" id=\"lnk-use\">Use</a><a href=\"#settings-in-the-layout-file\" id=\"lnk-settings-in-the-layout-file\">Settings (in the layout file)</a><a href=\"#without-the-module\" id=\"lnk-without-the-module\">Without the module</a><a href=\"#headless-pwa-studio-graphql\" id=\"lnk-headless-pwa-studio-graphql\">Headless (PWA Studio, GraphQL)</a><a href=\"#private-scenes\" id=\"lnk-private-scenes\">Private scenes</a></aside></section>"}